# Frontend structure (frontend-nextjs)

## App Router
- Routes: `frontend-nextjs/src/app/**`.
- File chuẩn: `page.tsx`, `layout.tsx`, `loading.tsx`, `error.tsx`, `not-found.tsx`, `route.ts`.
- Code chỉ phục vụ 1 route: colocate dưới route segment đó.

## Components
- Component dùng lại: `frontend-nextjs/src/components/`.
- CSS Modules colocate: `ComponentName.module.css` hoặc `page.module.css` cạnh file TSX.

## Contexts / Providers
- Contexts: `frontend-nextjs/src/contexts/`.
- Root providers: `frontend-nextjs/src/components/Providers.tsx` gọi từ `src/app/layout.tsx`.

## Lib
- Helpers/utilities: `frontend-nextjs/src/lib/`.
- Tránh đặt browser-only API trong file có thể bị import bởi Server Components.

## Imports
- Dùng alias `@/` (tsconfig paths) thay vì relative import dài.
